# Source assets that are inputs, not deliverables.
# The font library is 111 MB of .ttf/.otf originals that `scripts/subset-fonts.mjs`
# turns into the ~400 KB of woff2 actually served from public/fonts/web. The image
# dumps are the raw generator output that gets cropped and composited into
# public/assets/templates. Neither belongs in git history; both stay on disk.
apps/web/assets-src/fonts-library/
apps/web/assets-src/generated-*/

